Choose a license for your mod and replace this file with its full text.

Common choices:
  MIT           short and permissive: anyone may reuse the code, with credit
  GPL-3.0-only  anyone may reuse it, but changes they publish stay open
  CC-BY-4.0     for art and other content rather than code

https://choosealicense.com helps you decide. Then put its SPDX identifier in
mod.json.in, for example "license": "MIT", so the launcher and the mod index
show it.
